[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0039","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14186","title":"Fortinet FortiOS SSL VPN Web Portal 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS SSL VPN Web 门户的 login redir 参数存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。具有低权限的远程攻击者可通过向受影响参数注入恶意脚本或 HTML 代码，在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本，窃取会话凭证或实施钓鱼攻击。同时该参数还可注入外部 URL 实现 URL 重定向攻击。影响 FortiOS 6.0.0 至 6.0.4、5.6.0 至 5.6.7 及 5.4 以下版本，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。利用该漏洞需用户交互（如点击恶意链接）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14186"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-29T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:05:44Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 5.6.8、6.0.5 或 6.2.0 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可通过 CLI 禁用 SSL-VPN Web Portal 功能作为临时缓解措施：FortiOS 5.2/5.4/5.6 分支执行 `config vpn ssl settings` → `unset source-interface` → `end`；5.0 及以下分支执行 `config vpn ssl settings` → `set sslvpn-enable disable` → `end`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101955","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039891","https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-17-242","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14186.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14186.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14186.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14186.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-14186.rules","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-14186/poc/nuclei/CVE-2017-14186.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6364e58b3f8fc3b67ee674788d4aa8c15d4b2e01/2017/CVE-2017-14186.json","https://github.com/zcyberseclab/zscan/blob/8c5a8daeed6afdf16f6945c24a51469d37a023b9/poc_stats.md","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/d6fe395a24bf199f4378463556cdb6358fb8d2be/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14186.yaml","https://github.com/PetiteTaupe/automation-cve-testing/blob/8fbac77a20cb4af865eac2393918d158f1941817/data/raw/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14186.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Feb/26/Reports/Report.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0058","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-17059","title":"WordPress amtyThumb amty-thumb-recent-post 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 amtyThumb amty-thumb-recent-post（又名 wp-thumb-post）插件 8.1.3 版本中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞。攻击者可通过向 `amtyThumbPostsAdminPg.php` 文件传递特制的 query string 参数，在未经认证的情况下将恶意 JavaScript 代码注入页面。当管理员访问包含恶意参数的 URL 时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或页面篡改。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接），影响所有使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-17059"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-29T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:10:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 amtyThumb amty-thumb-recent-post 插件至最新版本（如已停止维护则卸载该插件）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则，对 amtyThumbPostsAdminPg.php 的 query string 参数进行输入过滤和输出编码，阻止未转义的 HTML/JavaScript 注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/NaturalIntelligence/wp-thumb-post/issues/1","https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/145044/WordPress-amtyThumb-8.1.3-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17059.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-17059.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17059.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-17059.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-17059-2978.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-17059-2980.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2017-17059.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2017-17059.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2017/17xxx/CVE-2017-17059.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17059.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-17059.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0057","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-17043","title":"WordPress Emag Marketplace Connector Plugin 反射跨站点脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Emag Marketplace Connector 插件 1.0.0 版本中 awb-meta-box.php 文件存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞。该漏洞源于对 HTTP GET 请求中 \"post\" 参数过滤不严，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造恶意 URL 并诱导已登录管理员点击，在目标浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，可窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或发起其他恶意操作。攻击条件要求用户交互（点击链接），影响范围限于浏览器端，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-17043"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-28T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:10:15Z","remediation":"立即更新 Emag Marketplace Connector 插件至最新版本，或直接删除该插件。如无法更新，在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层面添加规则，对 `/wp-content/plugins/emag-marketplace-connector/templates/order/awb-meta-box.php` 路径的 `post` 参数进行 HTML 编码过滤，阻止未转义的特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/145060/wpemagmc10-xss.txt","https://wordpress.org/support/topic/wordpress-emag-marketplace-connector-1-0-cross-site-scripting-vulnerability/","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8964","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17043.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-17043.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17043.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-17043.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-17043-2975.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-17043-2977.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2017-17043.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2017-17043.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2017/17xxx/CVE-2017-17043.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2017-17043.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17043.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0056","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-16894","title":"Laravel Laravel框架 环境配置文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Laravel 框架 5.5.21 及之前版本中存在信息泄露漏洞，源于 `src/Illuminate/Foundation/Console/KeyGenerateCommand.php` 中的 `writeNewEnvironmentFileWith` 函数使用 `file_put_contents` 写入 `.env` 文件时未限制文件访问权限，导致该配置文件可被直接通过 Web 访问。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过直接请求目标站点 `/.env` URI 获取数据库密码、应用密钥等敏感信息，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 Laravel 5.5.22 或更高版本，或配置 Web 服务器禁止访问 `.env` 文件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-16894"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-20T01:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:10:06Z","remediation":"升级 Laravel 至 5.5.22 或更高版本，该版本修复了 writeNewEnvironmentFileWith 函数中 .env 文件权限未限制的问题。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）配置中增加规则禁止直接访问 .env 文件：Nginx 添加 `location ~ /\\.env { deny all; }`，Apache 添加 `<FilesMatch \"^\\.env\"> Require all denied </FilesMatch>`。同时确保 .env 文件权限设为 600 或 640，仅允许所属用户读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153641/PHP-Laravel-Framework-Token-Unserialize-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://whiteboyz.xyz/laravel-env-file-vuln.html","https://twitter.com/finnwea/status/967709791442341888","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-16894.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-16894.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2017/CVE-2017-16894.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2017-16894.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/开发框架漏洞/Laravel .env 配置文件泄露 CVE-2017-16894.md","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/frame/Laravel/Laravel env 配置文件泄露 CVE-2017-16894.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/framework/Laravel-.env-配置文件泄露-CVE-2017-16894.md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2017/CVE-2017-16894.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2017-16894.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-16894.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-16894/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/H3dI/ENV-Mass-Exploit","https://github.com/LuanDevecchi/CVE201716894"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0056.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0056.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0016","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-1000163","title":"Phoenix Framework URL重定向漏洞","description":"Phoenix Framework 1.0.0 至 1.3.0-rc.0 版本存在未经验证的重定向漏洞（CWE-601），远程攻击者可构造恶意 URL 将用户重定向至不可信的外部站点，结合社会工程学手段实施钓鱼攻击。攻击者无需认证，但需诱使用户点击恶意链接。该漏洞影响范围广，可能导致用户凭证泄露或恶意软件下载。官方建议升级至修复版本或对重定向目标进行白名单校验。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-1000163"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-17T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:58:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 Phoenix Framework 至安全版本：v1.0.x 升级到 v1.0.5+，v1.1.x 升级到 v1.1.7+，v1.2.x 升级到 v1.2.3+，v1.3.0-rc.0 升级到 v1.3.0-rc.1+。在 mix.exs 中更新 phoenix 依赖后执行 `mix deps.update phoenix`。如无法升级，在 Controller 中重写 redirect/2 函数，检查 to 参数是否包含反斜杠 `\\` 字符并拒绝此类请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elixirforum.com/t/security-releases-for-phoenix/4143","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000163.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-1000163.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000163.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2017/1000xxx/CVE-2017-1000163.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-1000163_1.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-1000163_3.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-1000163","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-1000163.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-1000163_4.yaml","https://github.com/dragonkeep/GoAttack/blob/2aaf40db0a28fb52ea4cd0b95a7b155c877767a7/GoAttack-Api/service/lib/templates/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000163.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2017-1000163.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0017","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-1000170","title":"jqueryFileTree 目录遍历漏洞","description":"jqueryFileTree 是一个基于 jQuery 的文件树浏览组件，其 2.1.5 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。由于程序未对用户传入的路径参数进行充分过滤和校验，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造包含 `../` 等特殊字符的请求，遍历服务器上的任意目录并读取敏感文件（如配置文件、数据库凭证等），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响广泛，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至最新版本或对路径参数进行严格的白名单校验。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-1000170"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-17T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:58:51Z","remediation":"升级至 2.1.5 以上版本（如存在），但该项目已归档不再维护，建议手动修补 PHP 连接器脚本：在 jqueryFileTree.php 中获取 dir 参数后，使用 realpath() 解析绝对路径，并校验其是否以允许的根目录前缀开头，拒绝包含 ../ 的路径。同时限制连接器脚本仅可通过内部网络访问，或在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）中添加访问控制规则，仅允许特定来源 IP 请求该脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161900/WordPress-Delightful-Downloads-Jquery-File-Tree-1.6.6-Path-Traversal.html","https://github.com/jqueryfiletree/jqueryfiletree/issues/66","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49693","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000170.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-1000170.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-1000170.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000170.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-1000170-2842.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/8cdce133e25011854707bbda081d1789042b34cd/2017/CVE-2017-1000170/README.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/jqueryfiletree_project/jqueryfiletree/CVE-2017-1000170.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-1000170-delightful_downloads-7f20352f-386f-45ab-b719-8a70f5c11b02.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/9001-to-10000-templates/cve-2017-1000170-2841.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2017-1000170-2839.yaml","https://github.com/xerocorps/TFnuclei-templates/blob/d245eff8cac0c4c045abb6b87a2692c247f564bc/templates/CVE-2017-1000170-2f1afbe99f3a4b3fbcd2086e71fd1ce6.yaml","https://github.com/Nickguitar/Jquery-File-Tree-1.6.6-Path-Traversal"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0017.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0017.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0054","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-16877","title":"ZEIT Next.js 目录遍历漏洞","description":"ZEIT Next.js 2.4.1 之前版本中存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。攻击者可通过向 /_next 和 /static 命名空间下的 URL 发送特制的路径请求，利用目录遍历绕过访问限制，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、源代码等）。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 2.4.1 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-16877"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-17T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:10:04Z","remediation":"立即将 Next.js 升级至 2.4.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 /_next 和 /static 命名空间下的路径遍历问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）配置规则，阻止对 /_next 和 /static 目录的目录遍历请求（如拦截包含 ../ 的 URL 路径）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vercel/next.js/commit/02fe7cf63f6265d73bdaf8bc50a4f2fb539dcd00","https://github.com/zeit/next.js/releases/tag/2.4.1","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-16877.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-16877.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-16877.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2017-16877.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-16877-2970.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-16877-2973.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-16877-2969.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-16877-2972.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-16877-2974.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/nextjs-cve-2017-16877.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2017/CVE-2017-16877.yaml","https://github.com/ossf-cve-benchmark/CVE-2017-16877"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0306","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11882","title":"Microsoft Office 公式编辑器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 的公式编辑器组件（EQNEDT32.EXE）在处理 OLE 对象时存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向用户发送特制的 Office 文档并诱导其打开，成功利用该漏洞可在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 2007 Service Pack 3、2010 Service Pack 2、2013 Service Pack 1 及 Office 2016 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（打开恶意文档）。该漏洞已被广泛利用于 APT 攻击和勒索软件投放场景，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV）。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 11 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11882"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-11-15T03:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:31Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 11 月安全更新（对应 Office 版本：Office 2007 SP3 安装 KB4011604，Office 2010 SP2 安装 KB4011610，Office 2013 SP1 安装 KB4011611，Office 2016 安装 KB4011239），或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表禁用 Equation Editor 组件：以管理员身份运行 `reg add \"HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Office\\Common\\COM Compatibility\\{0002CE02-0000-0000-C000-000000000046}\" /v \"Compatibility Flags\" /t REG_DWORD /d 0x400 /f`，阻止 EQNEDT32.EXE 加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://reversingminds-blog.logdown.com/posts/3907313-fileless-attack-in-word-without-macros-cve-2017-11882","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101757","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039783","https://0patch.blogspot.com/2017/11/did-microsoft-just-manually-patch-their.html","https://0patch.blogspot.com/2017/11/official-patch-for-cve-2017-11882-meets.html","https://github.com/0x09AL/CVE-2017-11882-metasploit","https://github.com/embedi/CVE-2017-11882","https://github.com/rxwx/CVE-2017-11882","https://github.com/unamer/CVE-2017-11882","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-11882","https://researchcenter.paloaltonetworks.com/2017/12/unit42-analysis-of-cve-2017-11882-exploit-in-the-wild/","https://web.archive.org/web/20181104111128/https://embedi.com/blog/skeleton-closet-ms-office-vulnerability-you-didnt-know-about/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43163/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/421280","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-11882","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43163","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-11882.md","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules/CVE-2017-11882.yar","https://github.com/Ridter/CVE-2017-11882/blob/dcfb778f3c43da205a94ce98a145b0800adacdcd/Command109b_CVE-2017-11882.py","https://github.com/rip1s/CVE-2017-11882/blob/c1f93849434f19f177a5ee3b69b84fd865593d13/CVE-2017-11882.py","https://github.com/eset/malware-ioc/blob/812c573dc8c354210893775b2de97d1fbf29be1b/ramsay/README.adoc","https://github.com/SecWiki/office-exploits/blob/54322c15acdd4b837e65061308ad7d3838edba24/CVE-2017-11882/readme.md","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_cve-2017-11882.html.txt","https://github.com/redstackio/redstack-vault/blob/85cd4fca816d70b450af0cac6ca430e7220f41fb/tools/CVE-2017-11882-Exploit.md","https://github.com/Neo23x0/signature-base/blob/43b2b2faafdaeb7f00102673f62555a2feb04c1b/yara/exploit_cve_2017_11882.yar","https://github.com/embedi/CVE-2017-11882/blob/34a6595c39e59d87a5926d3c056d3589fa7b9ea5/webdav_exec_CVE-2017-11882.py","https://github.com/Ridter/CVE-2017-11882","https://github.com/rip1s/CVE-2017-11882","https://github.com/rxwx/CVE-2018-0802","https://github.com/Ridter/RTF_11882_0802"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0036","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12635","title":"Apache CouchDB 越权创建管理员漏洞","description":"Apache CouchDB 在 1.7.0 之前版本及 2.x 系列 2.1.1 之前版本中存在 JSON 解析差异导致的权限提升漏洞。由于 Erlang 与 JavaScript 两种 JSON 解析器对重复键的处理方式不同，攻击者可通过向 _users 文档提交包含重复 \"roles\" 键的 JSON 数据，利用第二个 roles 键通过写入授权检查，而第一个 roles 键用于后续用户权限判定，从而将普通用户权限提升为 _admin 管理员权限。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害严重。结合 CVE-2017-12636（远程命令执行漏洞），非管理员用户可获得服务器操作系统级命令执行权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12635"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-14T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:42Z","remediation":"升级到 Apache CouchDB 1.7.0 及以上版本，或 2.x 系列升级到 2.1.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制 `_users` 和 `_admin` 端点的外部访问，仅允许受信任内网 IP 连接 CouchDB 的 5984 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101868","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/6c405bf3f8358e6314076be9f48c89a2e0ddf00539906291ebdf0c67%40%3Cdev.couchdb.apache.org%3E","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/01/msg00026.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201711-16","https://support.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docLocale=en_US&docId=emr_na-hpesbmu03935en_us","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44498/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45019/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44498","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12635.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12635.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-12635.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2017-12635-2914.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/couchdb-cve-2017-12635.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/CouchDB/CVE-2017-12635.yaml","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e9eb8828b73f69cfae6bd74ec93b6e438b8e77d/release-notes/10.0/preview/preview6/libraries.md","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/CouchDB/%EF%BC%88CVE-2017-12635%EF%BC%89Couchdb%20%E5%9E%82%E7%9B%B4%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-12635/poc/xray/CVE-2017-12635.yml","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/active/CVE-2017-12635","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/7328ab6aaf7adbdc368c695f29b077ae955aa9f0/2017/CVE-2017-12635/README.md","https://github.com/assalielmehdi/CVE-2017-12635","https://github.com/cyberharsh/Apache-couchdb-CVE-2017-12635","https://github.com/Dungsocool/CVE-2017-12635_36"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0036.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0036.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0053","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-16806","title":"Ulterius Ulterius Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Ulterius 服务器 1.9.5.0 之前版本中的 RemoteTaskServer/WebServer/HttpServer.cs 文件的 Process 函数存在目录遍历漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 HTTP 协议向目标服务器发送特制的包含路径遍历序列（如 ../）的请求，绕过路径限制访问服务器文件系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Ulterius 服务器所有低于 1.9.5.0 的版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。官方已在 1.9.5.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-16806"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-13T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:09:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 Ulterius 至 1.9.5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理，限制对 RemoteTaskServer 路径的访问，并禁用不必要的 HTTP 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Ulterius/server/commit/770d1821de43cf1d0a93c79025995bdd812a76ee","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43141/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43141","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-16806.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-16806.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2017/CVE-2017-16806.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-16806.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-16806-2966.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2017-16806-1.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2017/CVE-2017-16806.yaml","https://github.com/xerocorps/TFnuclei-templates/blob/d245eff8cac0c4c045abb6b87a2692c247f564bc/templates/CVE-2017-16806_1.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-16806-2968.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2017-16806-2.yaml","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/038bbc4e769d48f20238029d708287b68d5d159f/data/cve-2017-16806-2967.yaml","https://github.com/rickoooooo/ulteriusExploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0555","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-16651","title":"Roundcube Webmail 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Roundcube Webmail 在 1.1.10 之前版本、1.2.7 之前版本及 1.3.3 之前版本中存在访问控制漏洞。该漏洞源于文件附件插件在处理 `_task=settings&_action=upload-display&_from=timezone` 请求时未正确校验用户权限，导致已认证的攻击者能够读取服务器文件系统上的任意文件，包括配置文件等敏感信息。攻击者需拥有有效的用户名和密码以建立会话，无需其他特殊权限。该漏洞于 2017 年 11 月已被发现在野利用，危害严重，可能导致数据库凭据、邮件配置等敏感数据泄露，进而被用于进一步攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-16651"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-11-09T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:09:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Roundcube Webmail 至 1.1.10、1.2.7 或 1.3.3 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可禁用文件附件插件（file-based attachment plugins）或限制 Web 应用对本地文件系统的访问权限。该漏洞已遭在野利用，应优先处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161226/Roundcube-Webmail-1.2-File-Disclosure.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101793","https://github.com/roundcube/roundcubemail/issues/6026","https://github.com/roundcube/roundcubemail/releases/tag/1.1.10","https://github.com/roundcube/roundcubemail/releases/tag/1.2.7","https://github.com/roundcube/roundcubemail/releases/tag/1.3.3","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2017/11/msg00039.html","https://roundcube.net/news/2017/11/08/security-updates-1.3.3-1.2.7-and-1.1.10","https://www.debian.org/security/2017/dsa-4030","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-16651","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-16651.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-16651.json","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2017/CVE-2017-16651.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/8cdce133e25011854707bbda081d1789042b34cd/2017/CVE-2017-16651/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-16651","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12b56937c03071ca373f3f6a59d2f43e819052a3/2017/16xxx/CVE-2017-16651.json","https://github.com/dvppvd/exploits/blob/49988651cdcfb0ef84da0442fca004ca35ac6287/roundcube/CVE-2017-16651.py","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2017/database/CVE-2017-1665/CVE-2017-16651-ropbear.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-16651.txt","https://github.com/sentora/sentora-core/blob/78e4041bfb981868dcfbebff47d1a991a09f3ca1/etc/apps/webmail/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/starnightcyber/Exploit-Database-For-Webmail","https://github.com/ropbear/CVE-2017-16651"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0024","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11512","title":"ManageEngine ServiceDesk 任意文件下载漏洞","description":"ManageEngine ServiceDesk 9.3.9328 版本存在任意文件下载漏洞，由于 download-snapshot URL 中的 name 参数对路径名限制不当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含路径遍历序列（如 ../）的特制请求，利用该参数下载服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 ManageEngine ServiceDesk 9.3.9328 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11512"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-11-08T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:01:55Z","remediation":"升级至 ManageEngine ServiceDesk Plus 最新版本（当前最新版为 15300，该版本已移除有漏洞的 /fosagent/repl/download-snapshot 接口）。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截对 /fosagent/repl/ 路径的访问请求，仅允许可信 IP 范围访问管理控制台，并限制应用服务器对敏感文件系统的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101789","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2017-31","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11512.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-11512.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-11512.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2017/11xxx/CVE-2017-11512.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-11512/poc/nuclei/CVE-2017-11512.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-11512","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-11512-2871.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/20/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-11512-2871.yaml","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a76ce74c1e8cc0558629a2ea198286e/nuclei-temps/Vulnerability-Templates/template2/cve-2017-11512-2871.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2017-11512-2870.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0706","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-5070","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 JavaScript引擎存在类型混淆漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意HTML页面触发该漏洞。在V8中，类型检查和处理逻辑存在缺陷，导致 JavaScript对象的类型验证失败。当引擎尝试对混淆后的对象执行类型特定操作时，可能会导致内存控制破坏或代码执行优化破坏。该漏洞影响所有Windows、Linux和Mac操作系统上的Chrome 59.0.3071.86之前版本，以及Android版本59.0.3071.92之前版本。攻击者无需认证即可远程触发漏洞，用户只需访问恶意网站即可触发，绕过沙盒保护，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞可用于链式攻击，结合其他漏洞利用，完全破坏进程隔离，实现本地代码执行。该漏洞的CVSS评分8.8，危害等级严重。谷歌已在2017年7月更新中修复此漏洞，用户需及时更新Chrome浏览器以获取保护。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-5070"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-10-27T05:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:19:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 到最新稳定版本（当前 124.0.6367.201 或更高版本），最低要求使用 118.0.6027.0 或更高版本，以获取修复的 V8 引擎。Windows 用户通过 chrome://settings/help 手动检查更新，或在 Windows Update 中启用“选择可选更新”。Linux 用户使用软件管理器更新谷歌Chrome包。macOS 用户通过 Chrome 菜单“关于 Google Chrome”自动更新。如无法立即更新，可删除或禁用 Flash 插件 (`chrome://settings/content/flash`) 并使用沙盒模式运行 (`chrome://settings/security`)，同时对可信网站启用严格的 SameSite-Cookie 设置以缓解潜在利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98861","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038622","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:1399","https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2017/06/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://crbug.com/722756","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201706-20","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-5070","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-5070.md","https://github.com/tunz/js-vuln-db/blob/26d3f06008cbf95d05f066d2bf2a220deff491fc/v8/CVE-2017-5070.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2017/5xxx/CVE-2017-5070.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-5070","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12ccf92eecf2db493c63630fd06d8245f1d02476/2017/5xxx/CVE-2017-5070.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-5070/README_KO.md","https://github.com/tanjiti/sec_profile/blob/26841ec64b9b7f07c07c4acb3ddbb6b2b5b25604/README_201801.md","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/vulnerabilities/blob/e2e26e9752f48c74445ee914f9b937effce2fc7c/cves/chromium/CVE-2017-5070.yml","https://github.com/xuechiyaobai/V8_November_2017/blob/e30af61fffe3aeee1aeab523bd5bef83d6a71044/README.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2017-5070"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0206","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11292","title":"Adobe Flash Player 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 27.0.0.159 及更早版本存在字节码验证缺陷，导致不可信值被用于数组索引计算，进而引发类型混淆（Type Confusion）漏洞。攻击者可构造特制的 Flash 文件，通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文档触发该漏洞，成功利用可在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞已被俄罗斯 APT28 组织在野利用，影响所有安装受影响 Flash Player 版本的 Windows、macOS 及 Linux 系统。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户立即升级或禁用 Flash Player。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11292"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-10-22T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:01:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 27.0.0.170 或更高版本。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并移除浏览器插件，改用 HTML5 替代方案。对于必须使用 Flash 的内部系统，启用 click-to-play 机制并限制仅访问受信任站点。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），APT28 等攻击团伙已在实际攻击中利用，应优先处置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101286","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039582","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2899","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb17-32.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201710-22","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-11292","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-11292.md","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_cve-2017-11292-apt28.html.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-11292","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2017/UBUNTU-CVE-2017-11292.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-11292.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-11292/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-11292.txt","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2017-11292","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-11292.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2017/CVE-2017-11292.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0051","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-15647","title":"FiberHome 路由器目录遍历漏洞","description":"FiberHome 路由器存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可通过远程向 /cgi-bin/webproc 端点发送特制请求，利用 getpage 参数配合构造的 var:page 值实现路径穿越，从而读取设备上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件）。该漏洞影响多款 FiberHome 路由器型号，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，可能导致敏感信息泄露，进一步扩大攻击面。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-15647"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-19T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:08:03Z","remediation":"建议立即限制对路由器 /cgi-bin/webproc 路径的访问，在防火墙或反向代理层面添加规则拦截包含 getpage 参数的请求；同时将路由器管理界面绑定到内网特定 IP，禁止从 WAN 侧访问；如设备支持，升级到厂商发布的最新固件版本；若无法升级，可考虑更换已停止维护的 FiberHome 设备为仍在安全更新支持期内的替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blogs.securiteam.com/index.php/archives/3472","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44054","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-15647.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8